ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">睡眠不足有损健康。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">そこら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那一带；那个地方附近；那；那件事；那一点；那么多；大约那个数量；左右；上下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92630\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそこらにいますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她在哪里吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">素材</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">そざい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原料；材料；资源；未加工木材；原木；题材；主题</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220963\">この<ruby>水着<rp>(</rp><rt>みずぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>伸縮性<rp>(</rp><rt>しんしゅくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のある<ruby>素材<rp>(</rp><rt>そざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でできている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这身泳衣是弹性材料做的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">阻止</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">そし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">阻止</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">阻</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">組織</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">そしき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span